{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>And any melakhah you shall not do.</b> As on Shabbat, because it is a festival day and a fast day. But on the other festivals it is written 'all melakhat avodah you shall not do,' but melakhot of food preparation were permitted. The warning we have heard; the punishment, from where? Scripture says: והאבדתי."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:14:42.290017757Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}